       ("does not state the derived total 1,542", then the composition string). Both were fixed
       by correcting V4-COVERAGE-RECONCILIATION.md, again not by touching the checker. The total
       then moved once more, to 1,543, when DISC-054 was raised — the check derives it from the
       registers and the document, so it followed automatically.

